speakerName":"Fukumoto","textMapHash":1625858050,"text":"This has been a big help. I'm sure Asagiri will make an excellent illustration!","nextNodeIds":[230350602]},{"nodeId":230350602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12717,"speakerName":"Fukumoto","textMapHash":2664409130,"text":"Thank you very much, Cyno. I'll be sure to send you a copy of the novel as soon as it's published.","nextNodeIds":[230350603]},{"nodeId":230350603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12717,"speakerName":"Fukumoto","textMapHash":3569075522,"text":"Uh, Cyno, the two decks you're holding are...?","nextNodeIds":[230350604]},{"nodeId":230350604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1058,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":1665929962,"text":"Didn't you promise to play a few games of Genius Invokation TCG with me earlier?","nextNodeIds":[230350605]},{"nodeId":230350605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12717,"speakerName":"Fukumoto","textMapHash":1089689650,"text":"Eh!? I—I'm not very good at it, so uh... Traveler! You're definitely better than me!","nextNodeIds":[230350606,230350607]},{"nodeId":230350606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":481527210,"text":"I've never played before.","nextNodeIds":[230350608]},{"nodeId":230350607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":700718794,"text":"You're better at this.","nextNodeIds":[230350608]},{"nodeId":230350608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1058,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":2775178146,"text":"Then the matter is settled. Here, take this quick attack deck.","nextNodeIds":[230350609]},{"nodeId":230350609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1058,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":1998723850,"text":"I'm going to use this relatively slower deck to see how I can deal with your attacks.","nextNodeIds":[230350610]},{"nodeId":230350610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":12717,"speakerName":"Fukumoto","textMapHash":1776015130,"text